{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22301","headline":"自咏 · 白居易","name":"自咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜镜隐白发，朝酒发红颜。\n可怜假年少，自笑须臾间。\n朱砂贱如土，不解烧爲丹。\n玄鬓化爲雪，未闻休得官。\n咄哉个丈夫，心性何堕顽。\n但遇诗与酒，便忘寝与餐。\n高声发一吟，似得诗中仙。\n引满饮一醆，尽忘身外缘。\n昔有醉先生，席地而幕天。\n于今居处在，许我当中眠。\n眠罢又一酌，酌罢又一篇。\n回面顾妻子，生计方落然。\n诚知此事非，又过知非年。\n岂不欲自改，改即心不安。\n且向安处去，其余皆老闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}